    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yee-Haw!! is a fast-paced roguelite game set in a strange wild west. Survive numerous waves of 30+ different kinds of hostile enemies and avoid random obstacles with the help of various powerups, bombs, weapons and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Numerous stats to improve through <strong>30+ powerups</strong>; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>12 Fusion Powerups</strong>, where certain combinantion of regular powerups gives you special stats, weapons and skills; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Three settings\u00a0</strong>with specific characteristics, such as environment boundries and obstacles; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple graphics, with a native resolution of 192x108 pixels, and engaging gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two CRT-like filters to add to the retro and old school experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill and level counter;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements.</p></li></ul>",
